 where the power of speech has been weaponized",[153,167,168,171],{},[156,169,170],{},"Quick Play",": 30-45 minute games perfect for casual and competitive play",[153,173,174,177],{},[156,175,176],{},"Beautiful Art",": Stunning illustrations by renowned fantasy artists",[133,179,181],{"id":180},"whats-included","What's Included",[150,183,184,187,190,193],{},[153,185,186],{},"120 High-quality cards",[153,188,189],{},"Rulebook with detailed mechanics",[153,191,192],{},"Custom dice set",[153,194,195],{},"Storage box with magnetic closure",[133,197,199],{"id":198},"purchase-options","Purchase Options",[138,201,202],{},"Available now on our store for $29.99 USD plus shipping.",[138,204,205],{},[206,207,208],"a",{"href":87},"Buy Now",[133,210,212],{"id":211},"license-open-gaming","License & Open Gaming",[138,214,215,217,218,221,222,226],{},[142,216,20],{}," is published under the ",[156,219,220],{},"Open Gaming License (OGL)",". The core mechanics are freely available for others to use, modify, and build upon in their own games. Visit ",[206,223,56],{"href":57,"rel":224},[225],"nofollow"," for the complete OGL terms and starter kit materials.",[133,228,230],{"id":229},"reviews","Reviews",[138,232,233],{},[142,234,235],{},"\"Era of Silence captures the tension of a society on the brink perfectly. The mechanics are elegant yet challenging.\"",[150,237,238],{},[153,239,240],{},"Tabletop Gaming Magazine",[138,242,243],{},[142,244,245],{},"\"A must-play for fans of strategic card games with a unique twist.\"",[150,247,248],{},[153,249,250],{},"Board Game Enthusiast",{"title":252,"searchDepth":253,"depth":253,"links":254},"",2,[255,256,257,258,259,260],{"id":135,"depth":253,"text":136},{"id":147,"depth":253,"text":148},{"id":180,"depth":253,"text":181},{"id":198,"depth":253,"text":199},{"id":211,"depth":253,"text":212},{"id":229,"depth":253,"text":230},null,"USD","2024-01-20T00:00:00.000Z","A strategic tabletop game set in a dystopian future where silence is the ultimate weapon