ators, or unique materials used in its construction.",{"title":252,"searchDepth":253,"depth":253,"links":606},[],"A striking augmentation with distinctive blue and purple coloration","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/augmented-blue-purple.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/augmented-blue-purple",{"title":599,"description":607},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/augmented-blue-purple",[569,570,571,572],"XJ4QQIPW9yg2iMklNITxFQYZHRuEhwP7gi9ESYjT82E",{"id":616,"title":617,"artist":348,"body":618,"date":263,"description":625,"extension":265,"featured":358,"fullImage":626,"game":131,"meta":627,"navigation":124,"path":628,"published":124,"seo":629,"stem":630,"tags":631,"thumbnail":626,"type":573,"__hash__":635},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/baxters-bullets.md","Baxter's Bullets",{"type":126,"value":619,"toc":623},[620],[138,621,622],{},"Baxter's Bullets are renowned throughout the wasteland for their reliability and stopping power. Each round is carefully crafted by skilled artisans who have perfected the art of ammunition creation in a world where every shot counts.",{"title":252,"searchDepth":253,"depth":253,"links":624},[],"Specially crafted ammunition designed for maximum effectiveness","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/baxters-bullets.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/baxters-bullets",{"title":617,"description":625},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/baxters-bullets",[632,633,593,634],"ammunition","weapon","special","3QHpj1QDlfNZCPu-BqmdflUZlGUi5x6X9jfETLMoLvc",{"id":637,"title":638,"artist":348,"body":639,"date":263,"description":646,"extension":265,"featured":358,"fullImage":647,"game":131,"meta":648,"navigation":124,"path":649,"published":124,"seo":650,"stem":651,"tags":652,"thumbnail":647,"type":573,"__hash__":654},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bio-eye.md","Bio-Eye",{"type":126,"value":640,"toc":644},[641],[138,642,643],{},"The Bio-Eye is a sophisticated ocular augmentation that grants enhanced vision, including night vision, threat detection, and targeting assistance. These rare devices are prized by scouts, snipers, and anyone who needs an edge in the dangerous world of Era of Silence.",{"title":252,"searchDepth":253,"depth":253,"links":645},[],"An advanced ocular augmentation providing enhanced vision capabilities","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/bio-eye.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bio-eye",{"title":638,"description":646},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/bio-eye",[569,570,653,572],"vision","fHgd1wXCrRGOy83hShhw6v4E0fpR6LycR20xqnexthc",{"id":656,"title":657,"artist":348,"body":658,"date":263,"description":665,"extension":265,"featured":358,"fullImage":666,"game":131,"meta":667,"navigation":124,"path":668,"published":124,"seo":669,"stem":670,"tags":671,"thumbnail":666,"type":573,"__hash__":674},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bolt-thrower.md","Bolt Thrower",{"type":126,"value":659,"toc":663},[660],[138,661,662],{},"The Bolt Thrower is a formidable weapon combining ancient design principles with scavenged technology. It launches heavy bolts capable of piercing armor and bringing down large creatures, making it a favored weapon among hunters and defenders.",{"title":252,"searchDepth":253,"depth":253,"links":664},[],"A powerful projectile weapon firing heavy bolts with devastating force","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/bolt-thrower.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bolt-thrower",{"title":657,"description":665},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/bolt-thrower",[633,672,673,593],"ranged","bolt","9_EZeWLkjPmQkegkjYSFuxiJhzFcuC8xe6tdt356njk",{"id":676,"title":677,"artist":348,"body":678,"date":263,"description":685,"extension":265,"featured":358,"fullImage":686,"game":131,"meta":687,"navigation":124,"path":688,"published":124,"seo":689,"stem":690,"tags":691,"thumbnail":686,"type":573,"__hash__":692},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bullets-reference.md","Bullets Reference",{"type":126,"value":679,"toc":683},[680],[138,681,682],{},"A detailed reference guide showcasing the variety of ammunition 